The original data were collected and labelled by the source authors and issue
tracker participants, not by this student project. No endorsement is implied.

Changes: the pilot selects five Python projects. Files under raw/ are unchanged
CSV members of the original archive. cleaned.jsonl is derived by preprocess.py:
text normalization, filtering, deduplication and assignment of evaluation splits.
Exact transformations and counts are documented in README.md and
../results/data_audit.json. Source hashes are recorded in source.json.
